  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Quick-pickled cucumbers are fridge pickles,  no sterilising, no long-term shelf life, no canning. The cucumbers are lightly salted first to draw out moisture, then covered in a sweet-sharp white wine vinegar brine with dill and garlic. They're ready in 4 hours and are crunchy, bright, and sharp. Makes one 750 ml jar."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
